# Line endings (2026-10-07): the repository stores LF for every text file and Windows checks out LF as well
# (core.autocrlf=false, core.eol=lf). Mixed CRLF/LF caused repeated tooling slips; merges use -X renormalize.
# Hashes in historical review reports were taken over the old bytes and are not re-derived.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.wav binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.zks binary
